on More Actions Previous Job Job Title Student Assistant - Digital Design VCSU Foundation Office Next Job Apply for Job Job ID 2959344 Business Unit Valley City State University Location Valley City Posted 06/16/2026 Full/Part Time Part-Time Department University Relations Close Date Open Until Filled Add to My Favorite Jobs Email this Job Position Information This is a part-time, non-benefited position. Only VCSU students are eligible to be hired in this position. Unsolicited applications to this posting will NOT be considered or responded to. This position is subjected to North Dakota Veteran's Preference requirements. Position Summary: As a student assistant in this department, your primary role is to support the office staff in updating and creating Foundation brochures & publications, creating social media posts/graphics in addition to other projects as assigned by the staff. The ideal candidate will be able to work up to 30 hours per week in the summer with opportunity to continue employment in the fall at 5-8 hours per week. These hours are flexible and may be adjusted to fit the student’s scheduling needs. Contact Information: Please refer position questions to kim.hesch@vcsu.edu or call 701-845-7403. If you would like assistance with your application, please contact Janna Kohler, Director for Career Services at janna.kohler@vcsu.edu or 701.845.7534. Apply for Job Explore Jobs Sign In New User"
