iption More Actions Previous Job Job Title VCSU Technology Education Student Assistant Next Job Apply for Job Job ID 2959805 Business Unit Valley City State University Location Valley City Posted 08/24/2026 Full/Part Time Part-Time Department Technology and STEM Education Close Date Open Until Filled Add to My Favorite Jobs Email this Job Position Information This is a part-time, non-benefited position. Only VCSU students are eligible to be hired in this position. Unsolicited applications to this posting will NOT be considered or responded to. This position is subjected to North Dakota Veteran's Preference requirements. Title: VCSU Student: Technology Education Student Assistant Department: Technology and STEM Education Reports to: Administrative Assistant; Technology and STEM Education Position Summary: As a student assistant in this department, your primary role is to support the areas of Technology Education, STEM Education, and Career and Technical Education as directed by your supervisor. Work up to 15 hours per week Monday - Friday, within the 8:00 am-4:00 time slot. Responsibilities/Expectations: Maintain confidentiality. Performs other duties as required or assigned pertinent to the position. Must be a positive role model on and off the job. Must know and abide by all University rules and regulations. Must maintain a positive attitude toward the position. Qualifications/Knowledge/Skills/Abilities: Be a full-time undergraduate student (basic). Minimum of 10 hours per week Self-motivated and ability to work unsupervised. TRAINING WILL BE PROVIDED Skill in observing situations. Ability to work and make decisions with minimal supervision. Good interpersonal skills and desire to be a team player. Experience with customer service- common courtesy in working with students, employees, and the public. Good organization and time management skills. Physical Demands Regularly required to move about.  Will be walking most of the shift. Contact Information: Please refer position questions to teresa.cole@vcsu.edu or call 701-845-7444. If you would like assistance with your application, please contact Janna Kohler, Director for Career Services at janna.kohler@vcsu.edu or 701.845.7534. Apply for Job Explore Jobs Sign In New User"
