      "description": "Explore Jobs Skip to Main Content Press Control+M to start dragging object ptnbsid=P8lHSTna3%2bcFwCRFXWMW4Ys5JDI%3d&ptpinrand=INVALID&ptpinhash=INVALID You are on HCM Production Welcome rsapplicant Back Job Description Search Category Name Search keywords Search in... Search Category Name Search Within 1 row 1 Search Category Name See All Recently Visited Clear All 50 rows Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results See More Other Suggestions 50 rows Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results Search Results No results to display Actions Home NavBar Help Sign Out Job Description More Actions Previous Job Job Title VCSU Student Assistant for Athletic Training Next Job Apply for Job Job ID 2959865 Business Unit Valley City State University Location Valley City Posted 08/31/2026 Full/Part Time Part-Time Department Athletics - Athletic Training Close Date Open Until Filled Add to My Favorite Jobs Email this Job Position Information This is a part-time, non-benefited position. Only VCSU students are eligible to be hired in this position. Unsolicited applications to this posting will NOT be considered or responded to. This position is subjected to North Dakota Veteran's Preference requirements. Position Summary: This position reports to the Head Athletic Trainer.  As a student assistant for the Athletic Training department, your primary role is to assist the Head and Assistant Athletic Trainers in providing the highest level of care at Valley City State University. Ability to work football games is required. Work schedule is subject to change based on the demands of athletic activity e.g., practices, games, treatment times. Students are expected to be on time and not to leave early. Daily field set-up and tear down as well as other duties assigned. Minimum Qualifications: Must possess an understanding of and respect for the confidential nature of the information handled in the Athletic Training Room and maintain healthcare privacy and confidentiality. Reliable, punctual, dependable, and high level of integrity Ability to provide basic wound care/first aid Familiar with physical demands of collegiate athletics Situational awareness Preferred Qualifications: First Aid/CPR certified Working toward major in related health care field Course work related to healthcare/sports medicine (i.e.: care and prevention of athletic injuries, upper and lower extremity evaluation, anatomy, and physiology etc.) Application Information: Click on the (Apply for Job) button, Resume and Cover Letter encouraged but not required. Contact Information: Please refer position questions to anna.bratsch@vcsu.edu or call 701-845-7165. If you would like assistance with your application, please contact Janna Kohler, Director for Career Services at janna.kohler@vcsu.edu or 701.845.7534. Apply for Job Explore Jobs Sign In New User"
    },
